      "question": "How far in advance should I start planning a move?",
      "answer": "Our moving checklist tool organizes planning across an eight-week countdown starting with budgeting and reserving transportation. Starting your preparations earlier can provide greater flexibility when selecting moving dates and securing reputable movers. Spreading administrative paperwork, sorting, and packing across two months prevents missed deadlines."
